# ViralDarshan — environment (OPTIONAL)
#
# You do NOT need this file. If DATABASE_URL is absent, the app automatically
# runs its own bundled in-process database (no install, no server).
#
# Only set this if you WANT to use your own PostgreSQL server:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@127.0.0.1:5432/your_db
#
# OPTIONAL HERE (or add from Dashboard > API Keys): AI visual topic gate.
# Add multiple providers for automatic fallback when a free tier is limited.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-key
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=your-key
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=your-key
#
# OPTIONAL: reliable public Instagram discovery with exact play counts.
# Apify has free monthly credits: https://console.apify.com/account/integrations
# APIFY_TOKEN=apify_api_your_token
#
# OPTIONAL: if Instagram asks yt-dlp to log in for otherwise public media,
# permit yt-dlp to use your own browser session (chrome, edge, firefox):
# INSTAGRAM_COOKIES_FROM_BROWSER=chrome
#
# OPTIONAL: comma-separated real Reel URLs in addition to automatic search:
# INSTAGRAM_REEL_URLS=https://www.instagram.com/reel/SHORTCODE1/,https://www.instagram.com/reel/SHORTCODE2/
